WEBVTT

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:30.160
Sunset.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.880
Remember you folded.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.040
Remember your place.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.456
Spend the night in Reno.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:43.256
Resent the safety of the slots,
sit at the blackjack table,

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.896
hand the dealer rent, retirement,

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.896
pray God cares enough to pony up an ace.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.496
(Laughter)

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:52.736
Leaving.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.456
Lunch on Lake Tahoe, they say, is deep

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:58.720
and cold enough to preserve a body whole.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:04.976
Railroad workers, mafia, military
and possibly a monster like Loch Ness --